                <span class="text-primary mt-0.5 shrink-0 font-bold text-base leading-none" aria-hidden="true" data-ps="src/pages/warehouse-distribution-security.astro:ynf38q">▸</span>
                <span data-ps="src/pages/warehouse-distribution-security.astro:ynf38r">Trucking facility based tracking and supplemental based services to coordinating all inbound and outbound traffic and inventory control.</span>
